{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/e/7ee16b4af95c35f1260cdd6908aebe9de0b835a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-b)^n,n\\ge2,ab\\ne0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"173\" height=\"18\" />, is expanded by the binomial theorem, it is found that when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/d/0fd6985a337d4a0b6395dd9a06fd5d7c62b2a32f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=kb$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is a positive integer, the sum of the second and third terms is zero. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d43ec8ba3ecc0220a119674c0e2955631e8e509.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\tfrac{1}{2}k(k-1)\\quad \\text{(B) } \\tfrac{1}{2}k(k+1)\\quad \\text{(C) } 2k-1\\quad \\text{(D) } 2k\\quad \\text{(E) } 2k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"490\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/d/0fd6985a337d4a0b6395dd9a06fd5d7c62b2a32f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=kb$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, we can write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/e/64eecd82b49577ff4325622fd846572c8fa8aec7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-b)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/7/ff7a7329b5d1646e532a5d1442f9c101508ca108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(kb-b)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />.\nExpanding, the second term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/c/1ecbe3f119412fe914aa5fb90a1dc311d143f4aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-k^{n-1}b^{n}{{n}\\choose{1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"102\" height=\"53\" />, and the third term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/5/b45a8d33833a69d4a37ea4128d452f6247f4de59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^{n-2}b^{n}{{n}\\choose{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"88\" height=\"53\" />, so we can write the equation\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/c/b4ce32d058aa729992586d21038a517ae9798036.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-k^{n-1}b^{n}{{n}\\choose{1}}+k^{n-2}b^{n}{{n}\\choose{2}}=0\\]\" width=\"251\" height=\"53\" />\nSimplifying and multiplying by two to remove the denominator, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f939c798b9d592410347014b8f3437ced4432412.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-2k^{n-1}b^{n}n+k^{n-2}b^{n}n(n-1)=0\\]\" width=\"261\" height=\"19\" />\nFactoring, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/a/16a45a2f061795398abf0c75ba84389dc00bf1f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[k^{n-2}b^{n}n(-2k+n-1)=0\\]\" width=\"208\" height=\"20\" />\nDividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/4/1b4175fecedc0ffc155ce4d530fd2cd7662f48a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^{n-2}b^{n}$\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/2/1b2da0bf65461a55a5dd31e9036e1d68b538ee6c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n(-2k+n-1)=0\\]\" width=\"155\" height=\"18\" />\nSince it is given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/f/53f12ec5ee4a2e5304810da76fbb60e0d3cf46c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> cannot equal 0, so we can divide by n, which gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/2/9e27d9d86c519ef42e19a28281463d330165d6eb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-2k+n-1=0\\]\" width=\"129\" height=\"14\" />\nSolving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/9/5f9fafce7623c22a41a4db837ea5cefeb431bd6a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n=2k+1\\]\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" /> so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME\" title=\"1969 AHSME\">1969 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1969 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1969\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" tit